# Rust (axum) starter.
# The repo root has a .gitignore too; this one covers this component's stack.
#
# `target/` is the big one: a debug build of this project is commonly 1-2 GB.
# GitHub rejects any single file over 100 MB, so committing it does not just
# bloat the repo, it blocks your push.

# Cargo build output
target/
**/*.rs.bk

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is COMMITTED for a binary crate (it pins the exact
# dependency versions your image builds from). Do not add it here.

# Local env -- real secrets belong in Vault, not here
.env
.env.local
!.env.example

# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
